        "a5": "First verify the card was copied completely (mind leading/trailing spaces). If confirmed invalid, keep the order number and a screenshot of the card, and contact customer service immediately for a reissue or refund after verification.",
        "q6": "Can I request a refund?",
        "a6": "Virtual goods are reproducible, so once the card is viewed, no-reason refunds are generally not supported. If there is a quality issue with the card itself, please contact customer service for verification."
